                "animated-hero"
            ],
            "eyebrow": "Bryntum Calendar",
            "heading": "A Modern JavaScript Calendar Solution",
            "body_html": "<p>The Bryntum Calendar is a modern calendar component with multiple views. Built using pure JavaScript, it easily integrates with <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/react-calendar/\"><span class=\"s1\">React</span></a>, <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/angular-calendar\"><span class=\"s1\">Angular</span></a>, and <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/vue-calendar/\"><span class=\"s1\">Vue</span></a> applications.</p>",
            "body_text": "The Bryntum Calendar is a modern calendar component with multiple views. Built using pure JavaScript, it easily integrates with React , Angular , and Vue applications.",
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "View Examples",
                    "href": "/products/calendar/examples/",
                    "title": "View Examples"
                },
                {
