            "heading": "Why choose a JavaScript event Calendar?",
            "body_html": "<p>Built with JavaScript, a core web technology, the JavaScript calendar component integrates into existing applications with a ready-to-implement range of interactive features.</p> <p>Choosing the Bryntum JavaScript Calendar for your application provides users with an expertly designed and highly performant calendar that has been thoroughly tested and proven in industry applications.</p>",
            "body_text": "Built with JavaScript, a core web technology, the JavaScript calendar component integrates into existing applications with a ready-to-implement range of interactive features. Choosing the Bryntum JavaScript Calendar for your application provides users with an expertly designed and highly performant calendar that has been thoroughly tested and proven in industry applications.",
            "links": [],
            "ctas": [],
