                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "Multiple Views",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Switch between layouts to understand tasks in a variety of ways. The Bryntum Calendar supports multiple views, including:</p> <ul class=\"ul1\"> <li class=\"li1\"><a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/basic/\">Day, Week, Month, Year, and Agenda views</a></li> <li class=\"li1\"><a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/day-agenda/\">Day Agenda,</a> <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/listview/\">Grid</a> views</li> <li class=\"li1\"><a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/dual-dayview/\">Dual-Day</a> view</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Switch between layouts to understand tasks in a variety of ways. The Bryntum Calendar supports multiple views, including: Day, Week, Month, Year, and Agenda views Day Agenda, Grid views Dual-Day view",
            "links": [
                {
