        {
            "id": "block_7f8a8ef5340328b7601457cdd648ee6d",
            "type": "text-mini-demo",
            "heading": "Live Demo",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"pre-title\">Try it yourself</p>  <p>The calendar has full support for recurring tasks. Your tasks can repeat in any pattern you need – daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly.</p>",
            "body_text": "Try it yourself  The calendar has full support for recurring tasks. Your tasks can repeat in any pattern you need – daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly.",
            "ctas": [],
            "demo_kind": "calendar",
            "demo_position": "right"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_8f1c153294c4e8675efe148425adf91f",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": [
                "image",
                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "Fully Customizable",
            "body_html": "<p>The Bryntum Calendar is styled with CSS variables, which you can use to modify the calendar’s appearance.</p> <ul class=\"ul1\"> <li>Use our themes or <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/custom-theme/\">create your own</a>.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Tailor the rendering of <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/custom-rendering/\">events, headings, and more</a>.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Adapt the UI for <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/month-agenda/\">mobile devices</a> with layouts that adjust to any <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/responsive/\">screen size</a>.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Add links and buttons to <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/tooltips/\">customize tooltips</a>.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Customize the <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/eventedit/\">event editor</a>, <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/custom-menus/\">context menu</a>, and <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/sidebar-customization/\">sidebar</a>.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "The Bryntum Calendar is styled with CSS variables, which you can use to modify the calendar’s  appearance. Use our themes or create your own . Tailor the rendering of events, headings, and more . Adapt the UI for mobile devices with layouts that adjust to any screen size . Add links and buttons to customize tooltips . Customize the event editor , context menu , and sidebar .",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "create your own",
                    "href": "/products/calendar/examples/custom-theme/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "events, headings, and more",
                    "href": "/products/calendar/examples/custom-rendering/"
