        {
            "id": "block_a19229e400d243cafae6308f92930552",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": [
                "image",
                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "50+ More Widgets",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Choose from a <a href=\"/products/calendar/examples/kitchen-sink/\">wide range of UI components</a> that easily make your app polished and professional:</p> <ul class=\"ul1\"> <li class=\"li1\">Add ready-to-use <strong>menus, toggles, sliders, charts, and more</strong> to the Bryntum Calendar.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Meet user needs with fewer clicks and less searching.</li> <li class=\"li1\">Implement and style widgets easily with our clear documentation.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Choose from a wide range of UI components that easily make your app polished and professional: Add ready-to-use menus, toggles, sliders, charts, and more to the Bryntum Calendar. Meet user needs with fewer clicks and less searching. Implement and style widgets easily with our clear documentation.",
